Footnote+ Hence the Fourth *a'*♭ was 53 cents (33 : 32) too sharp, and the Sixth *c''* was 43 cents (40 : 39) too flat, and they were consequently unusable without modification by the hand. The minor Seventh *d''*♭ was too flat by 27 cents (64 : 63), but unless played in (intended) @@FN@@
