@@FN@@
===
unison against the just form, it produces a better effect. 'In trumpets, strictly so called,' says Mr. Blaikley, 'a great portion of the length is cylindrical and the bell curves out hyperbolically, the two lowest partials are not required as a rule and are not strictly in @@FN@@
